---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Perqed — Automated Mathematical Exploration & Formal Verification"
  description="An automated framework for mathematical exploration, heuristic search, and formal verification in Lean 4."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Automated Formal Mathematics</p>
      <h1 class="hero-title">
        Mathematical exploration.<br>
        <span style="color: var(--accent);">Formalized in Lean 4.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Perqed is an experimental research system for exploring mathematical conjectures, computing analytical bounds, and verifying machine-checked proofs in Lean&nbsp;4 with zero auxiliary axioms.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#case-studies" class="btn btn-primary">View Case Studies ↓</a>
        <a href="/blog/" class="btn btn-ghost">Technical Notes</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/bneb/perqed" class="btn btn-ghost" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Key Case Studies -->
  <section class="section" id="case-studies">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Research Case Studies</p>
      <h2 class="section-heading">Recent Explorations</h2>
      <p class="section-lede">
        Case studies combining heuristic search, analytical bounds, and formal verification.
      </p>

      <div class="discoveries-grid">
        <div class="discovery-card">
          <div class="card-tag">Number Theory · Sieve Anatomy</div>
          <h3 class="card-title">Erdős–Graham Factorial Products</h3>
          <p class="card-source">Grounded in Terence Tao (<em>arXiv:2603.27990</em>, March 2026)</p>
          <p class="card-body">
            Analysis of the counting function for <code>a₁! a₂! a₃! = m²</code> by parameterizing the dominant H=1 family and computing the leading asymptotic constant:
          </p>
          <div class="card-formula">
            <code>C₁ = ∑ 1 / √(s(a₁!)) ≈ 4.265293...</code>
          </div>
          <ul class="card-list">
            <li>Identified exponential remainder decay: R(50) &lt; 10⁻⁶</li>
            <li>Evaluated sieve parity distribution and consecutive square collisions</li>
            <li>8 Lean 4 declarations audited with zero <code>sorryAx</code></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="discovery-card">
          <div class="card-tag">Diophantine Equations · Linear Forms</div>
          <h3 class="card-title">Generalized Cunningham Diophantine Equations</h3>
          <p class="card-source">Generalizing Panda (2024)</p>
          <p class="card-body">
            Parametrization and obstruction analysis for <code>pˣ + (2ᵏ p + 1)ʸ = z²</code> with odd primes p and k ≥ 2:
          </p>
          <div class="card-formula">
            <code>pˣ + (2ᵏ p + 1)ʸ = z²</code>
          </div>
          <ul class="card-list">
            <li>Mersenne & Affine solution families for (x=1, y=1)</li>
            <li>Modulo 8 & Modulo 4 algebraic obstructions for low exponents</li>
            <li>Baker–Davenport continued fraction reduction on log forms</li>
            <li>11 Lean 4 declarations audited with zero <code>sorryAx</code></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="discovery-card">
          <div class="card-tag">Topology · Graph Theory</div>
          <h3 class="card-title">Hamiltonian Torus Decompositions</h3>
          <p class="card-source">Decidable Universal Quantifiers</p>
          <p class="card-body">
            Formalized edge-disjoint Hamiltonian decompositions on 3D tori for M=4 (64 vertices) and M=6 (216 vertices) using decidable quantifier reflection.
          </p>
          <ul class="card-list">
            <li>Machine-checked proofs with zero <code>sorry</code></li>
            <li>Verified injection and orbit closure properties</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Architecture -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">System Design</p>
      <h2 class="section-heading">How Perqed Works</h2>
      <p class="section-lede">
        Heuristic search and analytical reductions paired with formal proof verification.
      </p>

      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <span class="step-n">01</span>
          <h3 class="step-title">Problem Ingestion & Formulation</h3>
          <p class="step-body">
            Parses mathematical context and conjecture statements from literature to extract search targets and parameter domains.
          </p>
          <span class="step-tech">Problem Ingestion · AST Parsing</span>
        </div>

        <div class="step">
          <span class="step-n">02</span>
          <h3 class="step-title">Depth & Technique Evaluation</h3>
          <p class="step-body">
            Evaluates candidate directions, prioritizing structural and analytical techniques over purely elementary identities.
          </p>
          <span class="step-tech">Depth Evaluator · Heuristic Scoring</span>
        </div>

        <div class="step">
          <span class="step-n">03</span>
          <h3 class="step-title">Analytical Bounds & Reductions</h3>
          <p class="step-body">
            Applies logarithmic linear forms and continued fraction reductions to establish explicit search bounds.
          </p>
          <span class="step-tech">Baker Engine · Laurent Bounds</span>
        </div>

        <div class="step">
          <span class="step-n">04</span>
          <h3 class="step-title">Formal Verification</h3>
          <p class="step-body">
            Mechanizes theorem statements and proofs in pure Lean 4, verified directly by the proof assistant kernel.
          </p>
          <span class="step-tech">Lean 4 · Spec Auditing</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta">
    <div class="container" style="text-align: center;">
      <h2 class="cta-heading">Open Source & Reproducible</h2>
      <p class="cta-body">
        All theorem specifications, machine proofs, and verification scripts are available on GitHub.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href="https://github.com/bneb/perqed" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Repository ↗</a>
        <a href="/blog/" class="btn btn-ghost">Technical Notes</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: 96px 0 72px;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5.5vw, 3.8rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .hero-sub {
    font-size: 1.12rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 580px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  /* Sections */
  .section {
    padding: 80px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .section-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .section-lede {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    max-width: 540px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* Discoveries Grid */
  .discoveries-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
    gap: 32px;
    margin-top: 48px;
  }

  .discovery-card {
    background: var(--bg-card, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03));
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 32px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .card-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .card-title {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .card-source {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .card-body {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .card-formula {
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .card-list {
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-left: 20px;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .card-list li {
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  /* Steps */
  .steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 48px 56px;
    margin-top: 48px;
  }

  .step-n {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .step-title {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .step-body {
    font-size: 0.93rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .step-tech {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  /* CTA */
  .cta {
    padding: 80px 0 40px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .cta-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .cta-body {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 460px;
    margin: 0 auto 32px;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero { padding: 56px 0 40px; }
    .section { padding: 48px 0; }
    .steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
  }
</style>
